graph TD
    subgraph Entry Points & Runners
        app[app.py <br/> CLI & User Interface] --> agent[agent.py <br/> Planning Loop & Session]
        eval[run_eval.py <br/> Evaluation Runner] --> agent
        test[test.py <br/> Unit Testing] --> agent
    end

    subgraph Core Agent & State Management
        agent --> trace[trace.py <br/> Step Logging & Formatting]
        agent --> config[config.py <br/> Settings & Limits]
    end

    subgraph Execution & Tool Layers
        agent --> tools[tools.py <br/> Local Tools: Outfit & Fit Card]
        agent --> mcpClient[mcp_client.py <br/> MCP Client Wrapper]
        mcpClient -.->|stdio Subprocess Pipe| mcpServer[mcp_server.py <br/> MCP Server: Search Listings]
    end

    subgraph Utilities & Data
        tools --> generate[generate.py <br/> LLM Model Wrapper]
        tools --> data[data/ <br/> Wardrobe & Listings JSON]
        agent --> utils[utils/ <br/> Data Loaders & Helpers]
    end
